            <p class="text-muted">Class 11 is the most critical year for your CA/CS journey.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="glass-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-box mx-auto"><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill"></i></div>
